OL,3,GNEWSAMan and woman jailed for murdering
OL,4,Astep-brother
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man and woman have been jailed for
OL,7,Fthe murder of his vulnerable
OL,8,Fstep-brother.
OL,10,FKenneth Newton, 57, and his partner
OL,11,FMelanie James, 63, both from
OL,12,FBirmingham, inflicted severe abuse on
OL,13,F28-year-old Rubin Blount while he was
OL,14,Funder their care.
OL,16,FBoth were sentenced to life in prison,
OL,17,Fwith a minimum term of 21 years, at
OL,18,FStafford Crown Court on Friday.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
